<title>UK: Sallie Mae sets $2.049 bln asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae sets $2.049 bln asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following three-tranche asset-backed bond was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STUDENT LOAN MARKETING ASSOCIATION</p>
<p>TRANCHE A1</p>
<p> AMT	  $1.19 BLN COUPON     **	  LEGAL MAT   25.OCT.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   L20.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD    **+46 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED. AVERAGE LIFE 2.5 YEARS.</p>
<p>		L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>TRANCHE A2</p>
<p> AMT	 $787.4 MLN COUPON     **	  LEGAL MAT   25.JAN.10</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   L20.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   REOFFER    **	  SPREAD    **+57 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED. AVERAGE LIFE SEVEN YEARS</p>
<p>		L-LONG FIRST COUPON,</p>
<p>		THERE ARE ALSO SUBORDINATED CERTIFICATES OF $71.8</p>
<p>		MLN, TO BE PRICED 91 DAY T-BILL + AROUND 85 BP</p>
<p>		RATED A2/A+, AVG LIFE 8.9 YEARS</p>
</text>
